                    It all started in a small kitchen with a simple dream: to find the perfect cookie recipe with the right amount of crisp on the outside, yet delightfully soft and chunky on the inside.
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">
                    At first, these were just baked as gifts and treats for friends and family. But after countless requests for more, we decided to share this goodness with everyone. Today, every Panderon cookie is made with the same love, dedication, and premium ingredients as the very first day we baked them.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
